target: where the ceiling is in one voxlogica run -- CPU, the event
        loop, or the block device under the store
method: getrusage(RUSAGE_SELF) at start and exit for the totals;
        in-process sampling on its own thread for the shape, rates
        computed from measured intervals (engine/measure.py).
        Device figures are /proc/diskstats io_ticks and sectors for
        the device backing the store; proc figures are
        /proc/self/io; thr D is our own threads in uninterruptible
        sleep, sampled once a second.

